    "detailed_description": "In this Marioid styled game you can help little cat Bobo.<br>Jump on enemies, run, scratch and spit furballs to fight your way back home.<br>Bobo feels completely powerless and struggles to get in shape at first, but he constantly learns new mechanics and abilities.<br><br>-  lovingly crafted Metroidvania with Jump\u00b4N\u00b4Run gameplay<br>-  more than 200 optional upgrades and keys<br>-  varied level design<br>-  atmospheric soundtrack<br>-  keyboard, ps4, xbox360 and series x controller support<br>-  free of ads or in app purchases<br>-  5-20 hours of gameplay<br>-  if your pc has problems processing hd graphics press &quot;3&quot; on your keyboard. <br>   This activates the 30FPS-mode to improve performance.<br>- Please keep in mind that this is no AAA game. It's the first game I ever worked on and it purposefully contains some unusual design-choices. So if you are not open minded this might not be for you.<br><br>If you need help with the game, you can watch this 100% walkthrough:<br><br><br><br> <br>            <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232950/extras/604df64e2fa65e791c8e254f5b4e3399.poster.avif?t=1693974391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232950/extras/604df64e2fa65e791c8e254f5b4e3399.webm?t=1693974391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
